
🚀 Welcome to Auggie CLI Agent by Augment Code!

To get started, please authenticate with Augment:

  auggie --login

This will authenticate you and start an interactive session where you can:
  • Edit files and write code
  • Execute tests and other commands
  • Create and review pull requests
  • Integrate with GitHub and other systems
  • Get help with development tasks

For automation, you can use environment variables or token files:
  • AUGMENT_SESSION_AUTH - OAuth session data (same format as ~/.augment/session.json)
  • --augment-token-file - Path to file containing authentication token

